# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT CREDENTIALS.
# If one of these ever lands in git history, it is public forever, even after
# you delete it. Rotate the secret, do not just remove the file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
client_secret_*.json
*credentials*.json
*-service-account*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.token

# Environment files. These hold API keys and connection strings.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output. Rebuildable, often large, and specific to your machine.
# Keep the folder itself so the path always exists; ignore what lands in it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/*
!outputs/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine UI state. These change every time you scroll or resize a pane,
# so committing them means constant meaningless diffs. Every other .obsidian
# file IS committed on purpose, so the vault opens configured for everyone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json

# Obsidian scratch files created by an accidental click.
Untitled*.canvas
Untitled.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local machine settings. Your personal Claude Code overrides and permissions
# belong to you, not to everyone who clones this. Setup also writes where
# Claude's memory lives into this file, as a path that only fits your computer.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A one-time note one session leaves for the next when work stops half done.
# The next session reads it and deletes it. Never worth keeping.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
HANDOFF.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating system and editor junk.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and build artifacts. Noise, never source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
